  "notes": "Trek trip planner Costs tab. Distinctive: KPI tiles with tinted pastel headers (pink for owe, mint for owed, peach for outstanding, grey for total) and huge colored amounts with de-emphasized currency symbol and cents. Expense cards have a colored category ribbon tab on the top-left corner (ACTIVITIES purple, FOOD & DRINK orange, TRANSPORT blue, ACCOMMODATION green, FLIGHTS cyan, OTHER grey), pastel icon tile, per-traveler colored initial avatars (Y purple, J pink, P green, T orange) in pill chips for splits, and 'you borrowed/you lent' red/green pills. Edit/delete live in a separate rounded capsule next to each card. Expense note fields expand/collapse inline. Dark #111827 pill for active tab and primary buttons. Settle-up panel lists Y→P transfers with Settle buttons. Help button opens a full-screen help modal scoped to the current screen (not visible in capture). Many gradient backgrounds (74) in tile headers/chips."
